    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "3. The first bail application moved on behalf of the applicant was dismissed by Coordinate Bench of this Court on 08.03.2021.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 617,
      "end": 742,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "08.03.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 731,
          "end": 741
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28726616501808167
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "4. Learned counsel for the applicant submits that applicant has falsely been implicated in the instant crime; has no criminal history and is languishing in jail since 21.12.2019.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 744,
      "end": 922,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "21.12.2019",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 911,
          "end": 921
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21335487067699432
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "He submits that in case,\nthe applicant is granted bail, he will not misuse the same and will furnish the bail surety as per the satisfaction of this Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 923,
      "end": 1078,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21340610086917877
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "5. Per contra, learned State Counsel submits that victim in her statements recorded under Section 161 & 164 Cr.P.C. has fully supported the prosecution version.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1079,
      "end": 1240,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 161",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1170,
          "end": 1181
        },
        {
          "text": "164",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1184,
          "end": 1187
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1188,
          "end": 1195
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "Furthermore, in the medical report of the prosecutrix, doctor has opined that her hymen was found torn.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1241,
      "end": 1344,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "2025:UHC:4775 6.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1345,
      "end": 1362,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "I have considered the submission advanced by the learned counsel for the parties.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1363,
      "end": 1444,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "7. Having regard to the facts and circumstances of the case, I am not inclined to grant bail to the applicant at this stage.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1445,
      "end": 1570,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09174495935440063
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "8. Consequently, the second bail application is rejected.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1572,
      "end": 1629,
